   "en": "That I would lose\nto you...!"
  },
  {
   "id": "MESSAGE071:0564",
   "jp": "強くなりましたね…",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MESSAGE071:056F",
   "jp": "キリエ、お前…\nやっぱり怪力だな……",
   "en": "Kylier, you...\nare one strong girl..."
  },
  {
